      <div type="clause" n="6.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAs">VI As</ref> 6.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ oxan to mancuse ⁊ cù to XX ⁊ swyn to X ⁊ sceap to scll.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">An ox shall be valued at a mancus and a cow at twenty pence, a pig at ten pence, and a sheep at a shilling.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et bos una manca (id est XXX den.) et uacca XX den. et porcus X den. et ouis solido (V den.) persoluatur.</ab>
      </div>
